Package: saira
Title: Biodiversity Data Standardization to Darwin Core
Version: 0.9.4
Authors@R: person("Rog\u00E9rio", "Nunes Oliveira", email = "rogerio@sibbr.gov.br", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Shiny application for standardizing biodiversity datasets to the
    Darwin Core standard. Provides bilingual interface (PT-BR/EN-US) with tools
    for data validation, column mapping, and taxonomic verification. Designed
    for use with SiBBr (Sistema de Informação sobre a Biodiversidade Brasileira).
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/rogerio-onza/saira
BugReports: https://github.com/rogerio-onza/saira/issues
